00:06:54.650 --> 00:06:56.470
- First of all, how does
he have juvenile diabetes?

00:06:56.470 --> 00:06:58.224
He's not of juvenile age.

00:06:58.224 --> 00:06:59.270
(text dinging)

00:06:59.270 --> 00:07:00.730
- This sounds like bad news.

00:07:00.730 --> 00:07:01.740
- Well, you'd think so,

00:07:01.740 --> 00:07:04.530
but all of your diseases
are in perfect balance.

00:07:04.530 --> 00:07:06.740
Here's the door to your body. You see?

00:07:06.740 --> 00:07:09.790
And these are oversized, novelty germs.

00:07:09.790 --> 00:07:11.730
That's influenza, that's bronchitis,

00:07:11.730 --> 00:07:13.090
and this cute little cuddle bug

00:07:13.090 --> 00:07:14.820
is pancreatic cancer. (chuckles)

00:07:14.820 --> 00:07:15.950
Here's what happens

00:07:15.950 --> 00:07:18.483
