00:07:31.770 --> 00:07:33.440
Also, if you're a good doctor

00:07:33.440 --> 00:07:35.180
and a lot of tests come up positive,

00:07:35.180 --> 00:07:38.120
you need to start looking for a cause

00:07:38.120 --> 00:07:41.010
that perhaps ties in all
of these diseases together.

00:07:41.010 --> 00:07:42.907
I don't just say, "Hey, you
got a bunch of diseases.

00:07:42.907 --> 00:07:44.320
"Deuces."

00:07:44.320 --> 00:07:46.670
- There's a crazy man
with a scalpel in ER!

