00:09:12.750 --> 00:09:14.130
So if you make contact with your mask,

00:09:14.130 --> 00:09:16.700
right away, you have to leave,
change gloves, re-scrub in,

00:09:16.700 --> 00:09:18.310
and then do the whole
process all over again.

00:09:18.310 --> 00:09:20.240
So my man is not sterile no more!

00:09:20.240 --> 00:09:22.160
- Dr. Nick Riviera!

00:09:22.160 --> 00:09:23.240
Remember me?

00:09:23.240 --> 00:09:26.570
- Well, if it isn't my
old friend, Mr. McGreg!

00:09:26.570 --> 00:09:29.440
With a leg for an arm
and an arm for a leg.

00:09:29.440 --> 00:09:31.270
- The only question I have
after watching that is

00:09:31.270 --> 00:09:32.860
what is that doctor's specialty?

00:09:32.860 --> 00:09:34.597
Dr. Nick, what do you do?

00:09:34.597 --> 00:09:36.230
"Simpsons," all in all,

00:09:36.230 --> 00:09:38.220
does a great job of teaching you medicine.

00:09:38.220 --> 00:09:39.330
Albeit satirically,

00:09:39.330 --> 00:09:41.910
but as you've seen with The
Onion episodes in the past,

00:09:41.910 --> 00:09:43.570
I don't mind a little satire.

